      "preview": "חָבַק: estreitar, abraçar.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָבַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: estreitar, abraçar (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבֵּקֹ</span>; mandaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܒܰܩ</span>, siríaco moderno <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܦܩ</span>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَبَقَ</span> II. <em>reunir</em> seus bens, etc., Frey<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחֲבוֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.5\">Ec 3:5</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.5\">Ec 4:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֶקֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.16\">2 K 4:16</a>;—<em>abraçar</em>, com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.16\">2 K 4:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.5\">Ec 4:5</a> (dito de <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכְּסִיל</span> = cruzar os braços, isto é, ficar ocioso; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חִבֻּק\" href=\"/BDB,_חִבֻּק\", dir=\"rtl\">חִבֻּק</a>); objeto não expresso <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.5\">Ec 3:5</a> (‖ <strong>Pi</strong>).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">חִבְּקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:5\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.5\">La 4:5</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַבֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:10\" href=\"/Genesis.48.10\">Gn 48:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַבֶּק־</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:13\" href=\"/Genesis.29.13\">Gn 29:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַבְּקֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:4\" href=\"/Genesis.33.4\">Gn 33:4</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַבְּקֵ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.6\">Ct 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.3\">8:3</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וּתְחַבֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.20\">Pr 5:20</a>, com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַבְּקֶ֫נָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.8\">Pr 4:8</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.5\">Ec 3:5</a>;—<em>abraçar</em> pessoas, sem objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">עת לִרְחֹק מֵחַבֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.5\">Ec 3:5</a> (‖ <strong>Qal</strong>); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:13\" href=\"/Genesis.29.13\">Gn 29:13</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:10\" href=\"/Genesis.48.10\">48:10</a> (E); seguido de sufixo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:4\" href=\"/Genesis.33.4\">33:4</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.8\">Pr 4:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.6\">Ct 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.3\">8:3</a>; com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.20\">Pr 5:20</a>; abraçar <span dir=\"rtl\">צוּר</span> por falta de abrigo <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a> (dos pobres); abraçar montes de refugos <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁפתות</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:5\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.5\">La 4:5</a>, isto é, são proscritos.",
