      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְרוֹן</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar: Hebrom (</strong><em>associação, aliança</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:18\" href=\"/Genesis.13.18\">Gn 13:18</a> +; com ה locativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְרוֹנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:36\" href=\"/Joshua.10.36\">Jos 10:36</a> + 6 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְרֹ֫נָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.1\">2 S 2:1</a>;—𝔊 Χεβρων; moderna <em>El-Ḫalîl</em> (ver Rob<sup>BR i. 213 f., ii. 73 ff.</sup> Guérin<sup>Judée iii. 214 ff.</sup>); antiga cidade no sul de Judá, onde (ou perto da qual) Abraão edificou um altar <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:18\" href=\"/Genesis.13.18\">Gn 13:18</a> (J), e onde havia um santuário no tempo de Davi <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.7\">2 S 15:7</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לפני י׳ בְּח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.3\">2 S 5:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.3\">1 Ch 11:3</a>; edificada 7 anos antes de Zoã no Egito segundo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:22\" href=\"/Numbers.13.22\">Nu 13:22</a> b (JE); sob um rei <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:3\" href=\"/Joshua.10.3\">Jos 10:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:23\" href=\"/Joshua.10.23\">23</a> (JE) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:10\" href=\"/Joshua.12.10\">12:10</a> (D); atribuída a Calebe <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:13\" href=\"/Joshua.14.13\">Jos 14:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:14\" href=\"/Joshua.14.14\">14</a> (JED) <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:20\" href=\"/Judges.1.20\">Ju 1:20</a> contudo ver <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.40\">1 Ch 6:40</a> (cf. v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.41\">41</a>); nome mais antigo <span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיַת (הָ)אַרְבַּע</span> segundo <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:15\" href=\"/Joshua.14.15\">Jos 14:15</a> (JED), cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:2\" href=\"/Genesis.23.2\">Gn 23:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:27\" href=\"/Genesis.35.27\">35:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:54\" href=\"/Joshua.15.54\">Jos 15:54</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:7\" href=\"/Joshua.20.7\">20:7</a> (todos P) <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:10\" href=\"/Judges.1.10\">Ju 1:10</a> b; ver também <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:13\" href=\"/Joshua.15.13\">Jos 15:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:11\" href=\"/Joshua.21.11\">21:11</a> (ambos P); chamada também <span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְרֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:19\" href=\"/Genesis.23.19\">Gn 23:19</a> (e <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:27\" href=\"/Genesis.35.27\">35:27</a>, ambos P); cidade de refúgio <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:13\" href=\"/Joshua.21.13\">Jos 21:13</a> (P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.42\">1 Ch 6:42</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵמֶק ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:14\" href=\"/Genesis.37.14\">Gn 37:14</a> (J); mencionada em outras passagens <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:22\" href=\"/Numbers.13.22\">Nu 13:22</a> a (JE) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:36\" href=\"/Joshua.10.36\">Jos 10:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:39\" href=\"/Joshua.10.39\">39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:21\" href=\"/Joshua.11.21\">11:21</a> (todos D) <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:10\" href=\"/Judges.1.10\">Ju 1:10</a> a; <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:3\" href=\"/Judges.16.3\">16:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.32\">2 S 2:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.9\">15:9</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.10\">2 Ch 11:10</a>; lugar frequentado por Davi, e durante 7 anos sua cidade real <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:31\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.31\">1 S 30:31</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.1\">2 S 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.2\">3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.1\">4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.1\">5:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.13\">13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.11\">1 K 2:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.1\">1 Ch 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.1\">11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.24\">12:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.39\">39</a> (van d. H. v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.38\">38</a>) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.27\">29:27</a>; ler também talvez em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">תחתו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.12\">2 S 3:12</a>, 𝔊L εἰς Χεβρων, cf. Dr; sede da rebelião de Absalão <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.10\">2 S 15:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרֵי ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.3\">2 S 2:3</a> morada dos homens de Davi.",
