      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְבֶּ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: coisa unida, lugar de junção</strong>;—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְבָּ֑רֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:11\" href=\"/Exodus.36.11\">Ex 36:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">17</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְבַּרְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:27\" href=\"/Exodus.28.27\">Ex 28:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:20\" href=\"/Exodus.39.20\">39:20</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>coisa unida</em>, dos panos das cortinas do tabernáculo (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֹבֶ֫רֶת\" href=\"/BDB,_חֹבֶ֫רֶת\", dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֶרֶת</a>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:5\" href=\"/Exodus.26.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:11\" href=\"/Exodus.36.11\">36:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:12\" href=\"/Exodus.36.12\">12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>lugar de junção:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  das cortinas <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">Ex 36:17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  das ombreiras do éfode <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:27\" href=\"/Exodus.28.27\">Ex 28:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:20\" href=\"/Exodus.39.20\">39:20</a> (todos P).",
